  "body": "let say we have \r\n\r\n       tmpl = document.createElement('template') \r\n\r\n\r\nI think there is no clear definition about using `append` `appendChild` `insertAdjacemnt...` \r\nso when using  ` tmpl.insertAdjacentHTML('afterbegin','<div> foo </div>')` in chrome for example\r\n   \r\n`tmpl.content` return empty fragment \r\n\r\nOn the other hand if we use `tmpl.innerHTML = '<div> foo </div>'` the  tmpl.content are good and what we expect ",
